--- MCQ item 1 inner HTML at 360px ---

<p>A teacher raises examination marks by narrowing teaching to past papers. On which definition of
effectiveness does this look best, and which does it damage? <em>(Understand)</em>
a) Best on observed practice; damages achievement gain
b) Best on breadth of outcomes; damages observed practice
c) Best on achievement gain; damages breadth of learner outcomes
d) It looks equally good on all three</p>

